@page installation "Installation"

There are two ways to obtain Peano: 
You can either download one of the archives we provide on the webpage, or you
can work directly against a repository clone (recommended).
We recommend to work against the latest release of Peano which you can get through

<pre>
git clone -b p4 https://gitlab.lrz.de/hpcsoftware/Peano.git
</pre>


in the directory where you've stored your downloaded file.



<code> libtoolize; aclocal; autoconf; autoheader; cp src/config.h.in .; automake --add-missing; </code>


